<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $55 (FIM 255.20).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $55 (FIM 255.20).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $0-5/8 to end at $55 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 255.20 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed down 8.00 markka at 255.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded on Wall Street on Friday. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 2.00 at 77.60 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-1/8 at $19-1/4 in New York on Friday. The price corresponds to about 89.30 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 lower at 89.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
